<title>DENMARK: Danish Great Belt raises amount on 4.0% bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Great Belt raises amount on 4.0% bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Great Belt (A/S Storebaeltsforbindelsen) raised an existing two billion crown, four percent, six year bond offer to 2.2 billion crowns, lead manager Unidanmark said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bond matures in 2003 and is listed on Copenhagen Bourse, it said.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
